flowchart TD
    A[POST /api/scans/] --> B[Validate target ID, scan name, type and PENDING status]
    B -->|Invalid| C[Return 422 validation error]
    B -->|Valid target| D[Create scan record]
    D --> E[(scans table: PENDING)]

    E --> F["POST /api/scan-execution/execute/{scan_id}?project_id=ID"]
    F --> G[Load scan and target]
    G -->|Missing record| H[Return 404]
    G --> I{Scan already RUNNING or COMPLETED?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Return 409 conflict]
    I -->|No| K{Target belongs to supplied project?}
    K -->|No| L[Return 400]
    K -->|Yes| M[Evaluate project scope rules]
    M -->|Out of scope| N[Mark FAILED and return 403]
    M -->|In scope| O[Mark RUNNING with start time]

    O --> P[Build bounded Nmap arguments for scan type]
    P --> Q[Run subprocess with timeout and XML output]
    Q -->|Timeout| R[Mark FAILED and return 504]
    Q -->|Tool failure| S[Mark FAILED and return 502]
    Q -->|Success| T[Parse Nmap XML]
    T --> U[Create exposed-service and CVE findings]
    U --> V[(vulnerabilities table)]
    V --> W[Store structured scan result and mark COMPLETED]
    W --> X[Return scan ID, target, summary and persisted count]

    Y[Service-aware tools and Exploit-DB enrichment] --> Z[Run after the guided Nmap stages in terminal workflow]
    Z --> V
